      "writtenOn": "2018-12-11T23:15:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I guess I don\u0027t see where the report_id is set in payload[0]. Is it already set from the incoming message? Are we sure that set_feature_report didn\u0027t change the buffer?\n\nPlease answer a few of these questions with comments above this section of code.",
